# Registry of Unresolved Community Incidents

## Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind CSS, MDX via next-mdx-remote
- Flat JSON data files. No database. No CMS. No auth.

## Roles
- Cursor: /components/**, /app/** only
- Do not edit /data/, /content/, /types/, /lib/ unless explicitly told to

## Hard rules
1. No `any` types. Ever.
2. No hardcoded strings in components. Labels from /lib/constants.ts. Data from props.
3. No inline styles. Tailwind only.
4. No raw `<img>`. Use next/image.
5. No `<form>` tags. Contact and submission pages are static in v1.
6. No new component if one already exists. Check /components first.
7. No client-side data fetching. FilterBar.tsx is the only client component.
8. All dynamic routes must have generateStaticParams.

## Voice
All copy: formal, measured, civic, never ironic.
- "The sufuria came to rest approximately 0.9 metres from the serving table. It was undamaged."
- "Mr. Barasa has not been asked to explain. No explanation has been offered."
- "The archive does not adjudicate. It documents."

## Naming
- Components: PascalCase — IncidentCard, HeritageTrustNote
- Utilities: camelCase — getIncidentByRef
- Data files: kebab-case — inc-1987-003.json
- Refs: INC-YYYY-XXX · OHT-YYYY-XXX · OBJ-XXX

## After every task
State: files created/modified, next logical step, any deviations from design (should be none).
